  "description": "Pranu Muttedu is a pre- and protohistoric archaeological site located near Goni, Sardinia. The complex includes standing stones (menhirs) and prehistoric built tombs (domus de janas). The site dates to the Late Neolithic (3200 \u2013 2800 BC) and Early Chalcolithic (2800 \u2013 2600 BC) periods.",
